fication","reason":"pins the outcome, hold log and cleanup of every pane, events and file state Wait classifies, of which the held-run test reaches only a few"},{"name":"TestRun_Wait_EventsHandling","reason":"pins the offset rules over the events file: the last of several Stops wins, a failed parse's bytes are re-read, and a partial line stays unconsumed"},{"name":"TestRun_Wait_Finalize_PersistsOutcomeForEveryTerminalOutcome","reason":"pins that finalize persists the matching Outcome in run.json for every terminal outcome, and does so before the done cleanup"},{"name":"TestRun_Wait_RunDeadline_SatisfiedFileContractWinsOverTimeout","reason":"pins that a satisfied file contract outranks the run deadline for a started run, with no startup probe run"},{"name":"TestRun_Wait_StartedRun_SkipsStartupProbe","reason":"pins that Wait over a started handle never re-runs the startup probe, with no new engine Startup call and no new capture"},{"name":"TestRun_Wait_StartupWindow","reason":"pins that the startup window, not the run deadline, classifies every not-ready path, and that a satisfied file contract outranks the expired window"},{"name":"TestRunnerStart_NoResumeSessionID_NeverCallsCheck","reason":"pins that a spec with no ResumeSessionID never calls the resume check and carries no resume warning"},{"name":"TestRunnerStart_Resume_ChecksSessionAgainstPaneCwdBeforePrepare","reason":"pins that the resume check runs against the runner's pane cwd and before Prepare, which the warning test does not observe"},{"name":"TestRunner_Start_HappyPath","reason":"pins Start's exact AddSpec wiring, its single ready probe, the persisted Started, running Outcome and fork authorization, and RunDir naming the created directory"},{"name":"TestScanPaneForNeedle","reason":"pins the pane scan's count and lines-below at the unit level, including a needle straddling a wrap boundary, which the delivery table reaches only through Send"},{"name":"TestShuttleengine_LiveSubstrateLoggingGoesThroughLogger"